Subject: Competitive play: a set's Mirror match
Upstream-base: a353c8f2dfb34eb08fecd725965a46ea629428e3

The online draft lets the drafting player pick only a captain nobody has
yet: NetworkDraft::IsCaptainTaken greys out the other team's captain, refuses
him, and the random pick when the time runs out skips him. A set's rules may
have Mirror match (src/platform/competitive_rules.cpp), the same in both
games. In the draft of a RANKED match against the set's opponent whose rules
have it (mscharged_competitive_draft_mirror, src/platform/competitive_match.cpp),
only "no captain" counts as taken, so both players may pick one captain. The
other machine takes any picked captain, as in retail.

The match then loads one captain on both teams. Through the set's draft and
games, the Mirror match tweak's own hooks (0015) count the tweak as on
(src/platform/game_tweaks.cpp), so both games dress the away team in its
away kit, made where the disc has none. Every other online draft is retail.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_competitive.h b/include/mscharged_competitive.h
--- a/include/mscharged_competitive.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_competitive.h
@@ -102,6 +102,13 @@
 bool mscharged_competitive_cheats(int* stadium, int* player, int* powerup);
 #endif
 
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+// A set's Mirror match (tweak patch 0052): true while this RANKED match's
+// draft is against the set's opponent and the set's rules have Mirror
+// match. The captain the other player picked stays available.
+bool mscharged_competitive_draft_mirror(void);
+#endif
+
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 }
 #endif
diff --git a/src/Game/NetworkDraft.cpp b/src/Game/NetworkDraft.cpp
--- a/src/Game/NetworkDraft.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/NetworkDraft.cpp
@@ -20,6 +20,9 @@
 #if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
 #include "platform/wii_qsort.h"
 #endif
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+#include "mscharged_competitive.h"
+#endif
 
 static NetworkDraft* sNetworkDraft;
 
@@ -584,7 +587,13 @@
     }
     for (int team = 0; team < mTeamCount; ++team)
     {
-        if (mTeams[team].mCaptain == captain)
+        if (mTeams[team].mCaptain == captain
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+            // Competitive play: a set with Mirror match lets both players
+            // draft one captain.
+            && !mscharged_competitive_draft_mirror()
+#endif
+        )
         {
             return true;
         }
